{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"椭圆曲线"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“椭圆曲线”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>椭圆曲线</strong> (elliptic curve) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"亏格","text":"亏格"}},{"Plain":"为 $1$ 且有有理点 $e\\in X(k)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"曲线","text":"曲线"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>一般的整系数椭圆曲线形如\n$$\r\nE \\colon y^2 + a_1 xy + a_3 y = x^3 + a_2 x^2 + a_4 x + a_6.\r\n$$\n在坐标变换 $y=\\frac{1}{2}(Y-a_1X-a_3)$, $x=X$ 之下, 上式变为\n$$\r\nY^2 = 4X^3 + b_2 X^2 + 2 b_4 X + b_6.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 任何椭圆曲线都可以写成\n$$\r\nX = \\{ y^2 = x^3 + ax + b \\} \\cup \\{\\infty\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>复数上的椭圆曲线</h3>\n<p>复数上的椭圆曲线可等价地定义为</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{C} / \\Lambda$, 其中 $\\Lambda$ 为格点;</li>\n<li>一维紧复 "},{"Local":{"url":"Lie群","text":"Lie 群"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>亏格 $1$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Riemann面","text":"Riemann 面"}},{"Plain":", 带有一个基点;</li>\n<li>$3$ 次代数曲线.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 设 $P,Q$ 是椭圆曲线上两点, 若 $P,Q$ 作为"},{"Local":{"url":"除子","text":"除子"}},{"Plain":"等价, 即 $P-Q=\\operatorname{div}(f)$, 则 $P=Q$, 即 $f$ 为常数.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"椭圆曲线的模叠"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"谷山–志村猜想","text":"谷山–志村猜想"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}